      *================================================================*
      * PROGRAM  : UTELIGCH                                            *
      * TYPE     : UNIT TEST DRIVER                                    *
      * PURPOSE  : UNIT TESTS FOR ELIGCHK - ACCOUNT OPENING ELIGIBILITY*
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      * CHANGE LOG                                                     *
      * 2017-02-10 AKW  ORIGINAL                                       *
      * 2020-08-03 JLM  MULTIPLE DECLINE REASONS (CHG1960)             *
      *================================================================*
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. UTELIGCH.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY TESTPARM.
       COPY ELIGPARM.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           MOVE 'INIT' TO TST-FUNCTION
           MOVE 'ELIGCHK' TO TST-SUITE-NAME
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS

           PERFORM 1000-TEST-ELIGIBLE
           PERFORM 1100-TEST-AGE-BOUNDARY
           PERFORM 1200-TEST-RETIRED-PRODUCT
           PERFORM 1300-TEST-KYC-PENDING-HYSV
           PERFORM 1400-TEST-KYC-EXPIRED
           PERFORM 1500-TEST-MIN-DEPOSIT
           PERFORM 1600-TEST-HYSV-MAX
           PERFORM 1700-TEST-CORPORATE
           PERFORM 1800-TEST-OFAC
           PERFORM 1900-TEST-MULTIPLE

           MOVE 'SUMM' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS
           STOP RUN.

      *    BASELINE: VERIFIED ADULT OPENING HYSV WITH 1000.00
       0100-RESET.
           INITIALIZE ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE 'HYSV'     TO ELG-PRODUCT-CODE
           MOVE 'SV'       TO ELG-PROD-CATEGORY
           MOVE 'I'        TO ELG-PROD-CUST-TYPE
           MOVE 'A'        TO ELG-PROD-STATUS
           MOVE 20170208   TO ELG-PROD-EFF-DATE
           MOVE 0          TO ELG-PROD-MIN-OPEN-AMT
           MOVE 'I'        TO ELG-CUST-TYPE
           MOVE 'A'        TO ELG-CUST-STATUS
           MOVE 'V'        TO ELG-KYC-STATUS
           MOVE 20280310   TO ELG-KYC-REVIEW-DATE
           MOVE 19850412   TO ELG-BIRTH-DATE
           MOVE 'RT'       TO ELG-SEGMENT
           MOVE 'C'        TO ELG-OFAC-STATUS
           MOVE 'L'        TO ELG-RISK-RATING
           MOVE 1000.00    TO ELG-OPEN-AMOUNT
           MOVE 1          TO ELG-EXISTING-SAME-PROD
           MOVE 20260930   TO ELG-AS-OF-DATE.

       1000-TEST-ELIGIBLE.
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE 'VERIFIED ADULT ELIGIBLE FOR HYSV RC 00'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'Y00' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-ELIGIBLE-FLAG TO TST-ACTUAL(1:1)
           MOVE ELG-RETURN-CODE   TO TST-ACTUAL(2:2)
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ
           MOVE 'AGE COMPUTED AS 41' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 41 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ELG-CUST-AGE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ.

       1100-TEST-AGE-BOUNDARY.
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 20080930 TO ELG-BIRTH-DATE
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE '18TH BIRTHDAY TODAY IS ELIGIBLE' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'Y' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-ELIGIBLE-FLAG TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 20081001 TO ELG-BIRTH-DATE
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE '18TH BIRTHDAY TOMORROW DECLINED E08' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'E08' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-DECLINE-CODE(1) TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 20080230 TO ELG-BIRTH-DATE
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE 'INVALID BIRTH DATE DECLINED E13' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'E13' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-DECLINE-CODE(1) TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ.

       1200-TEST-RETIRED-PRODUCT.
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 'SVST' TO ELG-PRODUCT-CODE
           MOVE 'B'    TO ELG-PROD-CUST-TYPE
           MOVE 'R'    TO ELG-PROD-STATUS
           MOVE 100.00 TO ELG-PROD-MIN-OPEN-AMT
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE 'RETIRED SVST NOT OPENABLE E02' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'E0208' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-DECLINE-CODE(1) TO TST-ACTUAL(1:3)
           MOVE ELG-RETURN-CODE     TO TST-ACTUAL(4:2)
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ.

       1300-TEST-KYC-PENDING-HYSV.
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 'P'      TO ELG-KYC-STATUS
           MOVE 10000.00 TO ELG-OPEN-AMOUNT
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE 'KYC PENDING HYSV 10000.00 ALLOWED' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'Y' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-ELIGIBLE-FLAG TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ
           MOVE 10000.01 TO ELG-OPEN-AMOUNT
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE 'KYC PENDING HYSV 10000.01 DECLINED E06'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'E06' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-DECLINE-CODE(1) TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 'P'    TO ELG-KYC-STATUS
           MOVE 'DDAP' TO ELG-PRODUCT-CODE
           MOVE 'DD'   TO ELG-PROD-CATEGORY
           MOVE 25.00  TO ELG-PROD-MIN-OPEN-AMT
           MOVE 0      TO ELG-EXISTING-SAME-PROD
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE 'KYC PENDING CHECKING DECLINED E06' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'E06' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-DECLINE-CODE(1) TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ.

       1400-TEST-KYC-EXPIRED.
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 'E' TO ELG-KYC-STATUS
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE 'KYC EXPIRED DECLINED E05' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'E05' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-DECLINE-CODE(1) TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 20260929 TO ELG-KYC-REVIEW-DATE
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE 'VERIFIED BUT REVIEW DATE PASSED E14' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'E14' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-DECLINE-CODE(1) TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ
           MOVE 20260930 TO ELG-KYC-REVIEW-DATE
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE 'REVIEW DUE TODAY STILL ELIGIBLE' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'Y' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-ELIGIBLE-FLAG TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ.

       1500-TEST-MIN-DEPOSIT.
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 'MMKT'  TO ELG-PRODUCT-CODE
           MOVE 'MM'    TO ELG-PROD-CATEGORY
           MOVE 'B'     TO ELG-PROD-CUST-TYPE
           MOVE 2500.00 TO ELG-PROD-MIN-OPEN-AMT
           MOVE 2499.99 TO ELG-OPEN-AMOUNT
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE 'MMKT 2499.99 BELOW MIN DECLINED E07' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'E07' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-DECLINE-CODE(1) TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ
           MOVE 2500.00 TO ELG-OPEN-AMOUNT
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE 'MMKT 2500.00 AT MIN ELIGIBLE' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'Y' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-ELIGIBLE-FLAG TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ.

       1600-TEST-HYSV-MAX.
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 4 TO ELG-EXISTING-SAME-PROD
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE '5TH HYSV ALLOWED' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'Y' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-ELIGIBLE-FLAG TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ
           MOVE 5 TO ELG-EXISTING-SAME-PROD
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE '6TH HYSV DECLINED E09' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'E09' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-DECLINE-CODE(1) TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ.

       1700-TEST-CORPORATE.
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 'COPR' TO ELG-PRODUCT-CODE
           MOVE 'DD'   TO ELG-PROD-CATEGORY
           MOVE 'C'    TO ELG-PROD-CUST-TYPE
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE 'INDIVIDUAL CANNOT OPEN COPR E03' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'E03' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-DECLINE-CODE(1) TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ
           MOVE 'C'  TO ELG-CUST-TYPE
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE 'CORPORATE IN RT SEGMENT DECLINED E10' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'E10' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-DECLINE-CODE(1) TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ
           MOVE 'CB' TO ELG-SEGMENT
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE 'CORPORATE CB SEGMENT ELIGIBLE (NO AGE CHECK)'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'Y' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-ELIGIBLE-FLAG TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 'T' TO ELG-CUST-TYPE
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE 'TRUST CANNOT OPEN INDIVIDUAL-ONLY HYSV E03'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'E03' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-DECLINE-CODE(1) TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ.

       1800-TEST-OFAC.
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 'H' TO ELG-OFAC-STATUS
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE 'OFAC POTENTIAL HIT DECLINED E11' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'E11' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-DECLINE-CODE(1) TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ.

       1900-TEST-MULTIPLE.
      *    IVANOV-LIKE: RESTRICTED STATUS, OFAC HIT, PROHIBITED RISK
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 'B' TO ELG-CUST-STATUS
           MOVE 'H' TO ELG-OFAC-STATUS
           MOVE 'P' TO ELG-RISK-RATING
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE 'ALL DECLINE REASONS RETURNED (3)' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'E04E11E1203' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-DECLINE-CODE(1) TO TST-ACTUAL(1:3)
           MOVE ELG-DECLINE-CODE(2) TO TST-ACTUAL(4:3)
           MOVE ELG-DECLINE-CODE(3) TO TST-ACTUAL(7:3)
           MOVE ELG-DECLINE-COUNT   TO TST-ACTUAL(10:2)
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ
           PERFORM 0100-RESET
           MOVE 'LPER' TO ELG-PRODUCT-CODE
           MOVE 'LN'   TO ELG-PROD-CATEGORY
           CALL 'ELIGCHK' USING ELIGCHK-PARMS
           MOVE 'LOAN PRODUCT NOT OPENABLE HERE E01' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'E01' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ELG-DECLINE-CODE(1) TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ.

       9000-NEQ.
           MOVE 'NEQ' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS.

       9100-AEQ.
           MOVE 'AEQ' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS
           MOVE SPACES TO TST-EXPECTED TST-ACTUAL.
